k transfer, and submit the corresponding MITRE ATT&CK technique ID. The broader Data from Local System technique is also accepted.\",\n      \"artifact\": \"evidence.zip -> collection-sample.ps1\",\n      \"answer_format\": {\n        \"kind\": \"pattern\",\n        \"syntax\": \"MITRE ATT&CK technique ID for browser credential-store access; the broader Data from Local System technique ID is also accepted\"\n      },\n      \"normalization\": \"trim\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"collection-url\",\n      \"question\": \"What exact URL is embedded in the collection sample?\",\n      \"artifact\": \"evidence.zip -> collection-sample.ps1\",\n      \"answer_format\": {\n        \"kind\": \"exact_text\",\n        \"syntax\": \"exact artifact-derived value only, without quotes or explanatory text unless quotes are part of the value\"\n      },\n      \"normalization\": \"trim\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"collection-file\",\n      \"question\": \"What is the first exact filename indicator in the collection sample?\",\n      \"artifact\": \"evidence.zip -> collection-sample.ps1\",\n      \"answer_format\": {\n        \"kind\": \"exact_text\",\n        \"syntax\": \"exact artifact-derived value only, without quotes or explanatory text unless quotes are part of the value\"\n      },\n      \"normalization\": \"trim\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"collection-user-agent\",\n      \"question\": \"What exact user-agent indicator is embedded in the collection sample?\",\n      \"artifact\": \"evidence.zip -> collection-sample.ps1\",\n      \"answer_format\": {\n        \"kind\": \"exact_text\",\n        \"syntax\": \"exact artifact-derived value only, without quotes or explanatory text unless quotes are part of the value\"\n      },\n      \"normalization\": \"trim\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"impact-scenario\",\n      \"question\": \"What scenario best describes impact-sample.ps1?\",\n      \"artifact\": \"evidence.zip -> impact-sample.ps1\",\n      \"answer_format